Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fade(500,500)\blur3}本字幕由悠哈璃羽字幕社制作，仅用于日语交流使用\N请勿私自二次上传及用作商业用途
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.00,0:00:10.20,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fade(500,500)\blur3}翻译:阿恁&雪音  校对:狗粮山  时轴:懒鬼后裔樰七  后期:冷面珺  压制:zoe  海报:狗粮山
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.28,0:00:05.34,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冰室  好久不见
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.07,0:00:11.21,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,这家伙是我的发小  叫火鸟
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.50,0:00:13.11,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我是不死鸟的后裔
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.21,0:00:17.54,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,不死鸟的…后裔？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.19,0:00:22.30,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我换了工作  从上周起调到这家公司的营业部了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.94,0:00:23.98,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我叫冬月
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.32,0:00:26.37,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,火鸟先生看上去很开心呢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.97,0:00:30.58,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,其实是因为  有个命悬一线的项目起死回生了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.06,0:00:33.27,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,毕竟我可是不死鸟的后裔
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.78,0:00:40.18,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,你说换了工作  上一份工作是干什么的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.36,0:00:41.26,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,上一份工作？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.45,0:00:44.54,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,是艺术家
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.05,0:00:46.24,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,艺术家？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.52,0:00:52.28,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,这是我的作品  主题是「喜悦」
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.59,0:00:54.64,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,喜悦…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.19,0:01:00.28,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,这是象征清晨充满希望的曙光
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.50,0:01:05.13,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,真是前卫啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.03,0:01:07.13,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.13,0:01:09.11,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,但是  为什么要换工作呢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.68,0:01:11.14,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,而且还是来我们公司
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.58,0:01:13.22,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.05,0:01:17.97,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,是追随着发小冰室先生的脚步而来…之类的？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.35,0:01:20.06,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,不  绝无可能
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.97,0:01:23.68,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,嘛  说来话长啦
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.47,0:01:27.46,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,音无小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.39,0:01:32.07,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,你打算休息到什么时候啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.16,0:01:35.63,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,抱歉  音无小姐要喝咖啡吗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.76,0:01:36.46,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.72,0:01:39.69,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,接下来要出外勤  火鸟你赶紧做准备
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.98,0:01:42.92,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,音无小姐  等等我呀
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.92,0:01:46.72,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,跟小雏鸟似的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.84,0:02:00.85,Koori-title,,0,0,0,,{\fade(800,900)\blur5\pos(1133.333,767.333)}第4话
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.84,0:02:00.85,Koori-title,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fade(800,900)\pos(1305.333,839.999)}假日约会与双人游戏
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.90,0:02:06.49,Koori-OP-JP,,0,0,0,, {\blur5\fade(300,300)}冷たい指先感じられる距離感
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.90,0:02:06.49,Koori-OP-CN,,0,0,0,, {\blur5\fade(300,300)}能感受到指尖冰凉的距离感
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.98,0:02:12.57,Koori-OP-JP,,0,0,0,, {\blur5\fade(300,300)}もどかしくて少し切ない
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.98,0:02:12.57,Koori-OP-CN,,0,0,0,, {\blur5\fade(300,300)}令人急不可待  又有些许愁绪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.27,0:02:18.58,Koori-OP-JP,,0,0,0,, {\blur5\fade(300,300)}ひとつずつ灯る街灯に呼応して
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.27,0:02:18.58,Koori-OP-CN,,0,0,0,, {\blur5\fade(300,300)}与一盏盏点亮的路灯遥相呼应
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.72,0:02:24.43,Koori-OP-JP,,0,0,0,, {\blur5\fade(300,300)}募っていく気持ちに気付いた
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.72,0:02:24.43,Koori-OP-CN,,0,0,0,, {\blur5\fade(300,300)}觉察到心中一点点积攒的感情
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.55,0:02:32.08,Koori-OP-JP,,0,0,0,,照れ隠してもクールぶっても {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.55,0:02:32.08,Koori-OP-CN,,0,0,0,,不管是遮羞  抑或是装酷 {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.36,0:02:34.97,Koori-OP-JP,,0,0,0,,見透かされそう {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.36,0:02:34.97,Koori-OP-CN,,0,0,0,,都像会被看透似的 {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.57,0:02:38.13,Koori-OP-JP,,0,0,0,,やさしく {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.57,0:02:38.13,Koori-OP-CN,,0,0,0,,温柔地 {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.13,0:02:40.38,Koori-OP-JP,,0,0,0,,Freeze for a minute {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.13,0:02:40.38,Koori-OP-CN,,0,0,0,,冻结一分钟 {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.47,0:02:43.39,Koori-OP-JP,,0,0,0,,心ごと {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.47,0:02:43.39,Koori-OP-CN,,0,0,0,,全心全意 {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.55,0:02:49.51,Koori-OP-JP,,0,0,0,,I miss you 言わせたくて {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.55,0:02:49.51,Koori-OP-CN,,0,0,0,,想让你说  我想你 {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.74,0:02:52.67,Koori-OP-JP,,0,0,0,,Let me love you honey {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.74,0:02:52.67,Koori-OP-CN,,0,0,0,,让我爱你  honey {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.86,0:02:55.70,Koori-OP-JP,,0,0,0,,言えない for real {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.86,0:02:55.70,Koori-OP-CN,,0,0,0,,说不出口  for real {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.95,0:03:03.69,Koori-OP-JP,,0,0,0,,いつか言葉にできたら {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.95,0:03:03.69,Koori-OP-CN,,0,0,0,,假如有朝一日能说出口 {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.91,0:03:32.05,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.65,0:03:42.28,Koori-an7,,0,0,0,,全国首映
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.65,0:03:42.28,Koori-an7,,0,0,0,,电影
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.65,0:03:42.28,Koori-an7,,0,0,0,,小猫乔治2
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.86,0:03:44.56,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,这张电影传单…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.21,0:03:49.58,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,是热门动画「小猫乔治」儿童频道上的作品
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.32,0:03:53.45,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我姑且知道它改编成了电影
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.67,0:03:56.27,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冬月小姐  这个…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.05,0:03:57.90,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,抱歉…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.58,0:04:04.37,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,你看到了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.60,0:04:05.10,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.56,0:04:10.26,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我喜欢这个…因为可爱
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.71,0:04:14.02,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我也喜欢可爱的你！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.39,0:04:18.11,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,「小猫乔治1」的电影你看了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.68,0:04:19.16,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,看了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.98,0:04:21.12,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,其实去年上映的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.94,0:04:25.74,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我混在孩子和家长堆里一个人去看的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.57,0:04:27.23,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,好强
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.41,0:04:32.73,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,原来这么有意思啊  我也去看看好了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.68,0:04:36.66,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我想了解冬月小姐喜欢的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.07,0:04:40.09,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,要一起去看电影吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.60,0:04:45.29,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,下周「小猫乔治2」就上映了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.40,0:04:51.08,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,可是  你没看过第一部会不会没那么有意思？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.56,0:04:52.93,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,不会的  我去
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.39,0:04:54.70,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,第一部我会在家补的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.45,0:04:56.80,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,那之后再联系
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.22,0:05:03.61,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,上次一起吃饭  这次是一起看电影
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.10,0:05:05.92,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,而且不是下班回家顺路的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.99,0:05:07.86,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,而是在休息日  二人独处
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.21,0:05:11.87,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,称其为「约会」也不为过吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.09,0:05:17.38,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,不行  人不能太飘
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.45,0:05:22.10,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,把电影院冻上就完了  要保持冷静
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.40,0:05:28.54,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,「小猫乔治」真有意思啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.77,0:05:33.50,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,无论看多少次都很有趣
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.40,0:05:40.40,Koori-p1,,0,0,0,,{\p1\pos(59.6,215.6)\fscx119\fscy160}m 0 0 l 0 -105 l 373 -104 l 373 0
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.40,0:05:40.40,Koori-picture8,,0,0,0,,{\pos(85.2,64.667)}冰室先生
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.40,0:05:40.40,Koori-picture8,,0,0,0,,{\pos(83.6,107.867)}-------------
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.40,0:05:40.40,Koori-picture8,,0,0,0,,{\pos(79.867,146.267)}您有一条新信息
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.40,0:05:45.40,Koori-picture8,,0,0,0,,{\frz23.63\pos(754,477.2)}我看了乔治的第一部。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.40,0:05:45.40,Koori-picture8,,0,0,0,,{\frz23.2\pos(795.6,558.8)}特别好看。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.66,0:05:44.44,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我看了乔治的第一部
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.40,0:05:48.91,Koori-picture8,,0,0,0,,{\frz339.9\pos(710.8,531.6)}功课看来做足了呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.40,0:05:48.91,Koori-picture8,,0,0,0,,{\frz339.9\pos(685.2,600.4)}我现在也在复习。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.24,0:05:48.56,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我现在也在复习
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.70,0:05:51.59,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冬月小姐也在看啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.93,0:05:54.24,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,两个人在同一时间看同一部电影诶
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.84,0:05:55.69,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,对了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.96,0:05:57.68,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我得先买好电影票
Dialogue: 1,0:05:59.67,0:06:06.67,Koori-picture8,,0,0,0,,{\pos(68,40)}电影票就由我来买吧。
Dialogue: 1,0:05:59.67,0:06:06.67,Koori-picture8,,0,0,0,,{\pos(68,108)}因为是合家欢影片，我们就选墙边的座位吧。
Dialogue: 1,0:05:59.67,0:06:06.67,Koori-picture8,,0,0,0,,{\pos(62,180)}下午2点30分的那场可以吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.67,0:06:06.67,Koori-p1,,0,0,0,,{\p1\fscx298\fscy225\pos(35.6,255.6)}m 0 0 l 0 -105 l 373 -104 l 373 0
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.87,0:06:02.41,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,电影票就由我来买吧
Dialogue: 1,0:06:02.88,0:06:06.80,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,因为是合家欢影片  我们就选墙边的座位吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.77,0:06:13.06,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冬月小姐真周到  我就不客气地交给她办好了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.93,0:06:15.68,Koori-picture4,,0,0,0,,{\an7}好
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.18,0:06:15.68,Koori-picture4,,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(78,32)}的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.68,0:06:19.44,Koori-p1,,0,0,0,,{\p1\fscx234\fscy216\pos(11.6,229.6)}m 0 0 l 0 -105 l 373 -104 l 373 0
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.68,0:06:19.44,Koori-picture8,,0,0,0,,{\pos(44,134)}靠前、靠后和靠过道，你有偏好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.68,0:06:19.44,Koori-picture8,,0,0,0,,{\pos(38,38)}还有稍贵一点的特等座。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.80,0:06:23.13,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,坐哪儿都行  只要和你坐在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.03,0:06:26.35,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,你身边就是我的特等座！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.36,0:06:30.79,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,糟了  直接将心声打了出来
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.45,0:06:31.70,Koori-p2,,0,0,0,,{\p1\fscx482\fscy561\pos(61.6,803.6)}m 0 0 l 0 -105 l 373 -104 l 373 0
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.45,0:06:31.70,Koori-picture8,,0,0,0,,{\fs100\pos(162,384)}坐哪儿都行。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.45,0:06:31.70,Koori-picture8,,0,0,0,,{\fs100\pos(154,552)}只要和你坐在一起，你身边就是我的特等座
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.20,0:06:38.71,Koori-p2,,0,0,0,,{\p1\pos(513.6,751.6)\fscx245\fscy341}m 0 0 l 0 -105 l 373 -104 l 373 0
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.20,0:06:38.71,Koori-picture8,,0,0,0,,{\fs70\pos(540,459.334)}我对位置没什么讲究。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.20,0:06:38.71,Koori-picture8,,0,0,0,,{\fs70\pos(544.667,571.334)}选冬月小姐觉得好的座位就行。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.83,0:06:44.71,Koori-picture8,,0,0,0,,{\pos(156.667,719.333)}那我就选靠过道偏后的座位啦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.94,0:06:44.70,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,那我就选靠过道偏后的座位啦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.47,0:06:52.81,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,说起来  看完电影后干些什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.53,0:06:55.39,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,果然还是去吃饭吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.28,0:07:05.75,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,但是…她只是邀请我去看电影而已
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.48,0:07:15.23,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,总之  看明天的气氛再说  赶紧睡了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.74,0:07:17.73,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,在看电影途中睡着了就糟糕了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.32,0:07:24.36,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,紧张到睡不着
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.86,0:07:30.63,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,该睡觉了  真期待明天呀
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.50,0:07:36.57,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,睡不着
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.90,0:07:41.76,Koori-an8,,0,0,0,,爸爸  这边这边
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.65,0:07:45.54,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冰室先生
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.30,0:07:49.31,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,你真早啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.00,0:07:51.28,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,等很久了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.80,0:07:54.68,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冰室先生？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.51,0:07:57.77,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,没有没有  我刚到
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.11,0:07:59.07,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,这样呀
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.33,0:08:03.28,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,休息日和冬月小姐二人独处不是梦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.90,0:08:05.28,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,心脏受到暴击
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.12,0:08:19.04,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,是他们俩？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.63,0:08:24.22,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,休息日两个人一起看电影啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.43,0:08:26.75,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,算了  我就一个人放松…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.89,0:08:28.22,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,不好意思借过
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.54,0:08:31.39,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,火鸟先生？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.83,0:08:36.47,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,噢你是…是蛟岛先生来着？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.14,0:08:38.50,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我是冴岛
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.66,0:08:43.82,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,那个  你怎么来看这部电影？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.07,0:08:45.66,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,正巧还在我旁边的座位
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.01,0:08:51.51,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,这电影我一直想看  恰好空位只剩这里了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.58,0:08:53.29,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.43,0:08:54.81,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.60,0:09:05.60,Koori-an7,,0,0,0,,全国限定10万张
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.60,0:09:05.60,Koori-an7,,0,0,0,,观众礼物
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.60,0:09:05.60,Koori-an7,,0,0,0,,能获得在电影里登场的秘密明星卡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.05,0:09:08.26,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,挨着我坐呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.79,0:09:13.20,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,糟了  才播完预告我就心潮澎湃了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.41,0:09:15.43,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,得注意至少别让这里下雪了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.53,0:09:20.96,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,可是  我究竟是为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.17,0:09:28.63,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,要和刚认识的男同事在休息日两人并坐地看「米」呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.51,0:09:40.55,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,一个不留神没收住
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.35,0:09:43.73,Koori-an8,,0,0,0,,好厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.85,0:09:53.61,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.81,0:09:54.63,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,乔治
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.47,0:09:59.15,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,啊  乔治终于和妈妈重逢了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.74,0:10:03.60,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,好虐  毫无尿点  好好看
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.92,0:10:07.69,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,长大了重看还能有新体会
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.35,0:10:10.54,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,都是多亏了与冬月小姐的相遇
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.46,0:10:21.18,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,得以体验到以往人生中没有的各种经历
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.03,0:10:25.65,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,「小猫乔治」也是  我一个人是绝不会来看的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.80,0:10:29.62,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,她哭了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.48,0:10:32.55,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,这一幕确实感人
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.19,0:10:35.28,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,可是  她在哭诶…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.58,0:10:41.80,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,怎么办  纸巾  手帕
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.56,0:10:54.56,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,谢谢…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.22,0:11:04.83,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我  是真的很喜欢她
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.54,0:11:09.26,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冰室先生也哭了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.59,0:11:10.87,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,是的  很惭愧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.31,0:11:13.12,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,因为太黑了  没有注意到
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.22,0:11:17.15,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冰室先生哭的时候会怎么样呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.75,0:11:20.44,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,开心的时候会出现雪人对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.97,0:11:22.10,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,这是秘密
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.04,0:11:25.74,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我能有机会见到吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.47,0:11:32.15,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,不过  能不哭是最好的啦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.78,0:11:34.01,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.47,0:11:37.50,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,说  说起来  关于接下来的行程
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.17,0:11:40.00,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,要要要  要吃饭…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.22,0:11:45.36,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,好像有点太早了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.50,0:11:47.21,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,确实
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.08,0:11:49.38,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,那  那就
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.50,0:11:50.95,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,那就喝个下午茶再回去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.65,0:11:53.43,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,请务必
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.31,0:12:03.28,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,好漫长啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.15,0:12:07.35,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,不愧是长达3小时35分钟的巨作
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.08,0:12:15.79,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,昨天的约会好开心啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.68,0:12:19.34,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,没想到今天却要加班  落差好大
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.76,0:12:23.13,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我还想好好回味回味的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.76,0:12:30.96,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,啊  辛苦了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.17,0:12:33.27,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冰室先生  你也辛苦了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.65,0:12:36.15,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冬月小姐也要加班吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.63,0:12:37.28,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.70,0:12:40.39,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我在等一个项目的回电
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.21,0:12:42.92,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冰室先生也加班吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.14,0:12:44.35,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.58,0:12:47.42,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我也在等电话
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.53,0:12:54.65,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,虽然我原本觉得  要加班  好惨  心累
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.56,0:12:58.43,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,但两人独处  加班  万岁
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.84,0:13:03.80,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我去泡点咖啡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.43,0:13:05.69,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,麻烦你了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.93,0:13:13.90,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,啊  我过于心潮澎湃把咖啡冻上了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.87,0:13:15.64,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,请用
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.81,0:13:16.53,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.02,0:13:35.79,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,没人打电话来呢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.49,0:13:40.12,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,只是等电话而已  我也没别的事可做
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.39,0:13:41.34,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我也是
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.76,0:13:43.87,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我们就老实在这儿等着吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.44,0:13:48.36,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,其实今天狐森小姐邀请我去吃饭了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.76,0:13:50.73,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,啊  这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.18,0:13:54.33,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,说起来  她和狐森小姐关系真好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.02,0:13:57.15,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我以要加班为由拒绝了她之后
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.73,0:14:00.14,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,她说会邀请其他人作为替代
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.16,0:14:03.45,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我也是没办法啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.01,0:14:07.49,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我可是没办法才邀请冴岛先生你的哦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.71,0:14:10.01,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,好  好  谢谢您嘞
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.56,0:14:14.82,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,哎呀  对于没有什么朋友的狐森小姐来说
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.08,0:14:16.39,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,肯陪你吃饭的我真是温柔啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.47,0:14:18.92,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,喂  你这话是几个意思
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.22,0:14:22.00,Koori-an8,,0,0,0,,几个意思呀你小子…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.12,0:14:21.83,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,不好意思  久等了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.69,0:14:28.04,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,音无小姐  火鸟先生
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.03,0:14:30.40,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,各位辛苦了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.01,0:14:33.26,Koori-p1,,0,0,0,,{\p1\pos(59.6,218.267)\fscx142\fscy177}m 0 0 l 0 -105 l 373 -104 l 373 0
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.01,0:14:33.26,Koori-picture8,,0,0,0,,{\pos(90.001,100.666)}---------------
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.01,0:14:33.26,Koori-picture8,,0,0,0,,{\pos(84.667,52.666)}狐森小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.01,0:14:33.26,Koori-picture8,,0,0,0,,{\pos(87.333,151.334)}您有一条新信息
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.63,0:14:34.61,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,说曹操曹操到  是狐森小姐的信息
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.80,0:14:40.40,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,和音无小姐他们汇合了  玩得很开心呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.25,0:14:44.70,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我得做点什么让冬月小姐打起精神来
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.37,0:14:47.57,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我想想  有什么呢…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.05,0:14:49.56,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,你们看了什么电影呀
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.10,0:14:51.67,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,是一部叫「米」的电影
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.86,0:14:53.18,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,这是什么电影
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.54,0:14:58.15,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,一部以全CG描绘出拟人化的米的一生的豪华电影
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.41,0:15:01.34,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,高潮场面是壮观的脱粒场景
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.40,0:15:04.00,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,这电影…好看吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.92,0:15:06.95,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,怎么会想到去看这部电影的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.22,0:15:10.32,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,这是部热议作品  网上的评价也很不错
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.54,0:15:12.19,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,就想着去看看好了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.27,0:15:12.99,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我是因为
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.78,0:15:16.42,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,音无小姐说自己喜欢吃米饭
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.80,0:15:19.25,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我是很喜欢米  不过只是喜欢吃罢了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.68,0:15:21.47,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,对脱粒什么的并不是很…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.32,0:15:23.66,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,说起来那天
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.88,0:15:27.54,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我看见冰室先生和冬月小姐两人单独去看电影了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.85,0:15:29.48,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,什么  那是什么意思
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.59,0:15:31.95,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,也就是说他们去电影院约会了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.32,0:15:32.79,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.11,0:15:34.59,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,他们会看什么电影呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.48,0:15:38.15,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我只记得肯定不是「米」…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.60,0:15:42.71,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,有什么  能让冬月小姐打起精神来的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.10,0:15:44.65,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,能让她打起精神来的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.55,0:15:48.25,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冰室先生  来玩词语接龙吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.65,0:15:50.66,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,词语接龙？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.00,0:15:55.00,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,是不是有点幼稚呀  抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.79,0:15:58.15,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我想不到什么别的有趣的事
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.14,0:16:03.42,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,词语接龙啊  在冬月小姐看来算是一件有趣的事吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.23,0:16:06.60,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,这也太可爱了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.26,0:16:09.13,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,不  这个主意很棒
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.92,0:16:10.62,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我们玩吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.82,0:16:13.92,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,{\fs60\pos(933.333,983.333)}shiritori
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.82,0:16:13.92,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,那  从词语接龙的ri开始
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.06,0:16:14.67,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,{\fs60\pos(962.666,973.333)}risu
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.06,0:16:14.67,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,松鼠
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.96,0:16:15.78,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,{\fs60\pos(962.667,972.667)}surume
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.96,0:16:15.78,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,干鱿鱼
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.96,0:16:16.54,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,{\fs60\pos(960,972.666)}mesu
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.96,0:16:16.54,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,手术刀
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.73,0:16:17.43,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,{\fs60\pos(962.667,975.333)}suika
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.73,0:16:17.43,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,西瓜
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.80,0:16:18.53,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,{\fs60\pos(962.666,975.333)}kakesu
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.80,0:16:18.53,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,樫鸟
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.63,0:16:22.75,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,糟了  我下意识地就接了su结尾的词
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.44,0:16:27.50,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我在干什么啊  好像在对她使坏一样
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.85,0:16:31.07,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,啊  果然
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.03,0:16:33.45,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,su  su…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.76,0:16:35.93,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我  我没有…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.26,0:16:38.00,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,这是误会  是误会啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.54,0:16:42.28,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,{\fs60\pos(936,980.667)}suki
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.54,0:16:42.28,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,{\pos(954.667,1056)}喜…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.40,0:16:47.11,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,{\fs60\pos(968,972.667)}sukiyaki
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.40,0:16:47.11,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,寿喜烧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.37,0:16:48.71,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,寿喜烧？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.64,0:16:50.85,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,吓我一跳
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.13,0:16:53.85,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,那天上映的电影有
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.26,0:16:58.33,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,「小猫乔治」「米」「炸虾杀手的挑战」
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.69,0:17:02.23,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,「花瓣般摇曳的恋爱」「冰原特快」
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.90,0:17:06.21,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,「小猫乔治」是合家欢电影  肯定不是这部吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.28,0:17:10.13,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,如果是恋爱片  冰室先生的情绪一激动
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.33,0:17:12.72,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,电影院怕不是要遭殃吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.08,0:17:14.70,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,那果然还是恐怖电影？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.89,0:17:19.90,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,无法想象他们俩害怕得尖叫的样子呢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.43,0:17:22.06,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,{\fs60\pos(968,972.667)}kinoko
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.43,0:17:22.06,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,蘑菇
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.30,0:17:22.98,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,{\fs60\pos(962.666,975.333)}koara
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.30,0:17:22.98,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,考拉
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.16,0:17:23.74,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,{\fs60\pos(970.667,967.333)}rakko
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.16,0:17:23.74,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,海獭
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.35,0:17:24.99,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,{\fs60\pos(965.334,964.667)}konbu
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.35,0:17:24.99,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,海带
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.10,0:17:26.27,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,{\fs60\pos(973.334,972.666)}buririanto  katto
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.10,0:17:26.27,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,明亮式切割
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.49,0:17:29.51,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,「冰原特快」是什么电影呀
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.48,0:17:32.48,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,在极寒的西伯利亚行驶的列车上
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.52,0:17:35.81,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,偶然同乘一辆车的被炉匠人和温泉专家…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.84,0:17:37.35,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,这得有多巧合啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.50,0:17:41.49,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,那就不知道了  总之就是由于刹车出了故障
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.49,0:17:46.58,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,在失控的列车中  二人齐心协力逃出生天的动作片
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.75,0:17:51.31,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我记得  被炉工匠和温泉专家在打破困境的过程中
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.60,0:17:53.91,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,二人坠入爱河  最终喜结良缘了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.22,0:17:58.86,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,啊  我知道这种桥段  叫做吊桥效应对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.09,0:18:03.34,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,两个人一起逃出险境后就会爱上对方的套路
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.57,0:18:05.37,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,逃出险境…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.29,0:18:10.52,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,说到二人一起渡过危机  他们俩是还在加班吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.26,0:18:16.41,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,也就是说他们一起渡过加班的危机  再坠入爱河吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.54,0:18:17.55,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,就是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.00,0:18:19.76,Koori-an8,,0,0,0,,{\fs60\pos(968,914)}toruneedo
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.00,0:18:19.76,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,龙卷风
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.10,0:18:20.96,Koori-an8,,0,0,0,,{\fs60\pos(968,914)}doonatsu
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.10,0:18:20.96,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,甜甜圈
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.32,0:18:22.26,Koori-an8,,0,0,0,,{\fs60\pos(978,922)}tsuinteeru
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.32,0:18:22.26,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,双马尾
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.65,0:18:23.88,Koori-an8,,0,0,0,,{\fs60\pos(968,920)}rukusenburuku
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.65,0:18:23.88,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,卢森堡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.24,0:18:25.25,Koori-an8,,0,0,0,,{\fs60\pos(960,918)}kurimanju
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.24,0:18:25.25,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,栗子馒头
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.88,0:18:26.94,Koori-an8,,0,0,0,,{\fs60}ushimitsudoki
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.88,0:18:26.94,Koori-an8,,0,0,0,,三更半夜
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.37,0:18:28.16,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,玩得好嗨啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.94,0:18:28.81,Koori-an8,,0,0,0,,{\fs60}kiritanpo
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.94,0:18:28.81,Koori-an8,,0,0,0,,切米糕
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.88,0:18:31.35,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,好想就这么永远接下去
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.19,0:18:30.25,Koori-an8,,0,0,0,,{\fs60}poruchiinitake
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.19,0:18:30.25,Koori-an8,,0,0,0,,牛肝菌
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.78,0:18:37.02,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,您好  我是冬月
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.15,0:18:38.78,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,电话打来了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.64,0:18:39.18,Koori-an8,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.49,0:18:42.94,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,也就意味着冬月小姐之后要回家了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.72,0:18:43.03,Koori-an8,,0,0,0,,好的  我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.09,0:18:46.39,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,要是时间能稍稍停在这一刻就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.30,0:18:47.39,Koori-an8,,0,0,0,,好的  再见
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.43,0:18:51.38,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冰室先生  我…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.07,0:18:57.08,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,你可以走了吗  真好啊  辛苦了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.17,0:18:57.71,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,不是的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.97,0:19:01.57,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,加班时间  延长了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.47,0:19:03.75,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,那可真是…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.42,0:19:06.37,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,别太在意
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.74,0:19:07.33,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.45,0:19:11.35,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冰室先生
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.55,0:19:17.47,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,你会不会有在打电话的时候随手涂鸦的习惯？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.10,0:19:18.80,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,会有
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.72,0:19:20.53,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,好可爱
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.75,0:19:26.05,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我没什么绘画的天赋  只能画成这样
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.63,0:19:27.57,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,这是猪吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.91,0:19:28.63,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,是猫咪
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.56,0:19:33.06,Koori-an7,,0,0,0,,正在确认
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.56,0:19:33.06,Koori-an7,,0,0,0,,稍后
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.56,0:19:33.06,Koori-an7,,0,0,0,,回电
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.56,0:19:33.06,Koori-an7,,0,0,0,,再等一会
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.00,0:19:31.50,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冬月小姐画的是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.67,0:19:32.40,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,是熊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.74,0:19:38.22,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,接下来  我们玩你画我猜吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.29,0:19:40.33,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.95,0:19:42.57,Koori-p1,,0,0,0,,{\p1\pos(59.6,218.267)\fscx142\fscy177}m 0 0 l 0 -105 l 373 -104 l 373 0
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.95,0:19:42.57,Koori-picture8,,0,0,0,,{\pos(86,54)}冬月小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.95,0:19:42.57,Koori-picture8,,0,0,0,,{\pos(82,100)}---------------
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.95,0:19:42.57,Koori-picture8,,0,0,0,,{\pos(84,148)}您有一条新信息
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.96,0:19:44.31,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,是冬月小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.08,0:19:48.08,Koori-picture8,,0,0,0,,{\pos(758,168)}我换头像了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.38,0:19:47.58,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,这是什么画
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.30,0:19:49.12,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.20,0:19:50.62,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,是工作上的联系吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.63,0:19:53.68,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,不  冬月小姐发来了好像是什么画的图片
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.61,0:19:56.65,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冰室？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.96,0:19:58.23,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,他好像在消息轰炸我
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.94,0:20:00.19,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,火鸟你听我说
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.36,0:20:03.26,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,你猜我这个头像的肖像画是谁画的？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.47,0:20:04.57,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,是冬月小姐啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.05,0:20:07.52,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,你猜冬月小姐的头像是谁画的？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.84,0:20:08.57,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,是我
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.69,0:20:12.00,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我竟然  和冬月小姐互画肖像画了！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.03,0:20:14.17,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冰室
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.51,0:20:17.34,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,从前就人不可貌相  是个热血男儿啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.63,0:20:19.27,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,但这句我必须要说
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.96,0:20:21.06,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,恭  喜
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.53,0:20:22.93,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,恭喜你啊  冰室
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.19,0:20:28.94,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,火鸟先生  你在恭喜什么
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.21,0:20:32.89,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我的挚友冰室好像和冬月小姐有了不错的进展
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.10,0:20:34.97,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,所以要恭喜他
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.82,0:20:38.19,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冰室先生和冬月小姐有了不错的进展？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.21,0:20:39.78,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,什么不错的进展
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.80,0:20:45.03,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,不会是他们一起渡过加班危机后产生了吊桥效应吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.15,0:20:49.12,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,狐森小姐她们没有回复我呢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.38,0:20:50.45,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我这边也是
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.78,0:20:54.00,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,难得我们特地把头像换成为彼此画的肖像画
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.40,0:20:55.95,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,好想听听他们的感想
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.50,0:21:00.73,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,您好  我是冬月
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.74,0:21:08.12,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,您好  我是冰室
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.11,0:21:11.97,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,好的  我明白了  再见
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.03,0:21:17.78,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,这次应该能下班回家了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.43,0:21:19.61,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,应该是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.29,0:21:24.73,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,要  要不  在回家路上去哪吃个饭？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.97,0:21:33.02,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我去拿下东西  你在出口等我一下吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.22,0:21:44.56,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,今天简直最棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.37,0:21:50.33,Koori-an8,,0,0,0,,他不接电话呢…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.59,0:21:51.89,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,什么进展呀  恭喜什么呀
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.97,0:21:52.80,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,婚约？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.16,0:21:56.63,Koori-an8,,0,0,0,,吊桥效应果然好厉害啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.88,0:21:56.44,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我感觉绝对不是
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.45,0:22:20.98,Koori-ED-JP,,0,0,0,,ふと気づけばまた視線は　追い掛けてしまう君の姿
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.45,0:22:20.98,Koori-ED-CN,,0,0,0,,突然发觉之时  视线又追逐上你的身影
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.21,0:22:36.05,Koori-ED-JP,,0,0,0,,嫌なことがあっても心は　雨上がりの空のように
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.21,0:22:36.05,Koori-ED-CN,,0,0,0,,即使遇上坏事  心也如雨后初晴的天空
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.52,0:22:49.36,Koori-ED-JP,,0,0,0,,君の笑顔はどうしてこんなにも　ポカポカで温かいの
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.52,0:22:49.36,Koori-ED-CN,,0,0,0,,你的笑容为何  如此和煦温暖春风拂面
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.59,0:22:57.07,Koori-ED-JP,,0,0,0,,ねぇ、教えて　君のこと　何でもいいからさ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.59,0:22:57.07,Koori-ED-CN,,0,0,0,,告诉我可以吗  只要是关于你什么都行
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.28,0:23:04.16,Koori-ED-JP,,0,0,0,,好きなこと　好きなもの　私にだけそっと
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.28,0:23:04.16,Koori-ED-CN,,0,0,0,,只悄悄告诉我  你喜欢的事也好物也罢
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.38,0:23:11.77,Koori-ED-JP,,0,0,0,,ねぇ、教えて　いつの日か　二人のこの距離を
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.38,0:23:11.77,Koori-ED-CN,,0,0,0,,告诉我可以吗  总会有一天我们的距离
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.15,0:23:22.48,Koori-ED-JP,,0,0,0,,少しずつ　少しずつ　なんて少しだけ期待してる
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.15,0:23:22.48,Koori-ED-CN,,0,0,0,,我无比期待着  它能一点一点日渐缩短
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.97,0:23:31.97,Koori-an7,,0,0,0,,小猫乔治
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.97,0:23:31.97,Koori-an7,,0,0,0,,集28分必得！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.49,0:23:34.51,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,这  这是…
